# Coverage report for SonarQube Cloud (`cargo llvm-cov`, .github/workflows/ci.yml).
/lcov.info
# Editor state. Written by VS Code / Cursor when the SonarQube IDE extension
# binds the workspace; its `connectionId` names a connection local to one
# machine, and the only shareable part -- the project key -- is already in
# `sonar-project.properties`, which is what CI and the tooling read. A binding
# meant to be shared belongs in the portable `.sonarlint/connectedMode.json`
# instead.
/.vscode/
